  "name": "CLL PANEL - FISH",
  "code": "1408",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1312\">\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1312\"><strong data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1236\">del(13q14)</strong>: Most common in CLL, generally associated with a <strong data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1309\">favorable prognosis</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1383\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1329\">trisomy 12</strong>: Intermediate prognosis, variable clinical outcome.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1464\">\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1464\"><strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1398\">del(11q)</strong> (ATM): Associated with <strong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1444\">aggressive disease</strong>, lymphadenopathy.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1574\">\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1574\"><strong data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1479\">del(17p)</strong> (TP53): <strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1506\">Poor prognosis</strong>, resistance to chemotherapy; may benefit from targeted therapies.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1636\">\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1636\">Absence of abnormalities: May suggest <strong data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1627\">low-risk</strong> disease.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
  "showInterpretation": false,
